#
# This directory's EXISTENCE is the behaviour. `hasGlossaryDir` in
# server/scripts/export-terminology.js enumerates books by it, so without this file
# edlisfraedi-2e is skipped SILENTLY: no refusal, no /api/health entry, no D6 clock —
# despite physics carrying 5,496 tagged translations, the second-largest corpus.
#
# With it, the book reaches `refused-absent-baseline` (register §C21): a VISIBLE,
# deadline-clocked refusal and no write. Adoption remains a separate, deliberate
# `--adopt` decision that the cron cannot reach.
#
# Do not delete to "tidy up" — that silently removes the book from the export again.
